{"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ropes\/SK","doc:\/\/Ropes\/Sl","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/SQ","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s25ExpressibleByArrayLiteralP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/SH","doc:\/\/Ropes\/SM","doc:\/\/Ropes\/Sk","doc:\/\/Ropes\/Sm","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/ST"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Rope"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The chunks, each up to a few kilobytes of elements, are the vertices of an AVL tree in flat"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrays, in sequence order, and each vertex records how many elements its subtree holds, so an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offset is found from the root in O(log "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") (Boehm, Atkinson and Plass, “Ropes: an Alternative"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to Strings”, 1995). Each chunk is its own copy-on-write buffer: a copy of a rope shares every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"chunk with the original until one of them edits it, and appending one rope to another shares"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the appended rope’s chunks."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var text = Rope(\"Hello, world!\")","text.insert(contentsOf: \"brave new \